<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45194" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">squāmōsus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-mossus</span></b> ), a, um,
			adj.
		squama, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of</i> or <i>covered with
			scales</i>, <i>scaly</i>, <i>squamous</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post - Aug.
			prose). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pecus (i. e. pisces),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Rud. 4, 3, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">soleamne esse avis squamossas?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Men. 5, 5, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">draco,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 408</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venter cerastae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				3</span></i>
			 (4), 22, 27: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orbes (anguis),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 41</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">greges (piscium),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 17, 2</span></i>
			: agmina, Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 5, 144: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">belua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Hippol. 1048</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pellis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Laud. Stil. 1, 263</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">thorax,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Ham. 423</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">smaragdi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 5, 18, § 72</span></i>
			.— <b>Poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lingua,</span>”
				<i>stiff</i>, <i>rough</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					4, 325</span></i>
			.</div>
